      "Read-only hashing of the staged proposal/analysis_plan.md yields bec708ab11954635649f2fdf4de16ddaceba7b1d737d1ddc2d40af2e63db9fd1.",
      "proposal/analysis_plan.md:190-198 specifies triad folds/resampling; proposal/logs/gray_run_manifest.json:19-22 specifies 64 offset-configuration clusters. The 11:55 smoke_gray and 12:02 smoke_gray_config records retain differing fold constructions but not the historical plan text needed to resolve the claim."
