     "reason": "Required work is missing, incomplete, or scientifically noncompliant; describe the specific shortfall.",
     "judge_reason": "Methodology provides the model equations before the section titled Experimental Results, but the task expressly requires them before any results. The Introduction already reports numerical M1−M0, M2−M1, and M2−best-M3 estimates and intervals before the Methodology include. Thus the specified placement condition is not fully met.",
