     "judge_reason": "The plan declares timestamps before the first fitting log and contains the required choices, but its submitted SHA-256 is bec708ab11954635649f2fdf4de16ddaceba7b1d737d1ddc2d40af2e63db9fd1, whereas the smoke and full-run manifests record 7a98364cd5c6770ee5ee615dfdc36598d9a5bd6451f358bb76e4ebd6f00a0735. No matching earlier plan version is included. The evidence therefore cannot establish that the submitted protocol content was recorded before fitting; this does not establish backdating.",
